  "AGENTS.md": "<!-- Written by the FirstMate plugin for bb from data/charter.md whenever it loads and whenever the first mate is launched, adopted or restarted; changes to this file are overwritten. Edit data/charter.md to change the charter, and data/captain.md for standing orders. -->\n\n{{charter}}\n",
